\begin_inset Formula $d_{\infty}$
\end_inset

" היא שלכל 
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{x},\vec{y}\in\MKreal^{n}$
\end_inset

 ולכל 
\begin_inset Formula $k\in\MKnatural$
\end_inset

 מתקיים 
\begin_inset Formula $d_{k}\left(\vec{x},\vec{y}\right)\geq d_{k+1}\left(\vec{x},\vec{y}\right)$
\end_inset

